{"type":"message","id":"a6b7c8d9","parentId":"f5a6b7c8","timestamp":"2026-11-03T09:12:44.310Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the CLI spawns children of its own. Setpgid makes the CLI the leader of a new process group, which means a single kill(-pgid) reaches the CLI and everything it started."},{"type":"text","text":"Killing only the CLI's pid would orphan those children, so cancel and timeout both signal the group."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","usage":{"input":2380,"output":96,"cacheRead":2200,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4676,"cost":{"input":0.0071,"output":0.0014,"cacheRead":0.0007,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0092}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1762161164310}}
